      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIREWORKS (7) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last five runs. Last time finished 3rd in a Grade 5 on August 4 over 410m at Horsham behind Relax Mate beaten 1.5 lengths (23.65). The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Likely to feature again. BUSH MAYHEM (2) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at this track over 390m behind Sharapova Star (22.99) in a Free For All. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Likely to play a prominent role. INGA JOHNNY (4) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Finished second (22.43) at this track last time making it two minors on end. Solid record here winning nine races. Overdue and expected to feature again. MAN OF COURAGE (1) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
